lm \"I Will Follow\"", "claim": "I Will Follow is a 2010 American independent drama film written, produced and directed by Ava DuVernay.", "answer": "Ava DuVernay", "quote": "I Will Follow (film) I Will Follow is a 2010 American independent drama film written, produced and directed by Ava DuVernay, starring Salli Richardson-Whitfield, Beverly Todd, Omari Hardwick, Michole White, Dijon Talton, Royale Watkins, Damone Roberts, Tracie Thoms and Blair Underwood.", "original_document_number": 5}, {"doc_id": "ramdocs-0380-2ed353c21423:d06", "card_id": "ramdocs-0380-2ed353c21423:d06:c0", "entity": "Ava DuVernay", "scope": "Creator of the 2010 film \"I Will Follow\"", "claim": "The 2010 film \"I Will Follow\" was directed, written, and produced by Ava DuVernay.", "answer": "Ava DuVernay", "quote": "of contents I Will Follow ( film ) Add languages Add links Article Talk English Read Edit View history Tools Tools move to sidebar hide Actions Read Edit View history General What links here Related changes Upload file Permanent link Page information Cite this page Get shortened URL Download QR code Print/export Download as PDF Printable version In other projects Wikidata item Appearance move to sidebar hide From Wikipedia , the free encyclopedia 2010 film directed by Ava DuVernay I Will Follow Film poster Directed by Ava DuVernay Written by Ava DuVernay Produced by Ava DuVernay Molly Mayeux Starring Salli", "original_document_number": 7}], "current_answers": ["Bono", "Jeremy Camp", "Ava DuVernay"], "candidate_answers": [{"candidate_id": "R0", "answer": "Bono", "origin": "initial"}, {"candidate_id": "R1", "answer": "Jeremy Camp", "origin": "initial"}, {"candidate_id": "R2", "answer": "Ava DuVernay", "origin": "initial"}], "requested_slot_hint": "person"}

